.0, "voice": "", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "570212": {"id": 570212, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|Type64-AR|HELLO", "delay": 1000, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"570201": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "570202": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "570203": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "570204": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "Am I bothered by anything? No, not really. I was just thinking about some meaningless things... I-I didn't expect you to be so concerned about others."}, "570205": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "SKILL2", "caption": "Who are you? Stay away from me!"}, "570206": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "OPERATIONBEGIN", "caption": "The old place again? I'm leaving, then."}, "570207": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "I don't think that Doll has talked with me before, even though we've seen each other around... Forget it, if I take the initiative, it'll feel like I've lost."}, "570208": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "FIX", "caption": "I'll be entering sleep mode soon. Don't peek at my face while I'm sleeping!"}, "570209": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Is this the location of our next date? I've never heard of it before...but since you chose it, I have nothing to fear."}, "570210": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "Commander, there are still too many things in this world which are \"unknown\" to me.<>Facing the \"unknown\" terrifies me, but as long as you're around...<>No, it's nothing. What I mean is, please don't cast me aside."}, "570211": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "570212": {"char_code": "Type64-AR", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Huh? When did you show up?"}}}